    <section anchor="security-considerations" numbered="true" removeInRFC="false" toc="include" pn="section-3">
      <name slugifiedName="name-security-considerations">Security Considerations</name>
      <t indent="0" pn="section-3-1">This document simply creates IANA registries for code points defined
in <xref target="RFC4379" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC4379"/> and <xref target="RFC6424" format="default" sectionFormat="of" derivedContent="RFC6424"/>.  Thus, there are no new security
concerns.</t>
